      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my knee is acting up real bad with my osteoarthritis and i can barely walk today. i'm on eliquis for my afib so i wanna be careful but i really need something for the swelling. can i just take some ibuprofen to get it under control? how much should i take to make sure the inflammation actually goes down?",
